Debra A. Cash
Deb is a Partner with Arthur Andersen LLP in the Energy Practice with 12 years of experience serving clients in the Oil and Gas industry.  She began with the firm in 1987 and was promoted to Manager in 1991 and Partner in 1998.  Deb has extensive experience serving clients in various industries including commodity marketing and trading and exploration and production companies.  She has additional experience in energy price risk management and related controls.  Deb received her B.S. from Northern Illinois University.  Deb is a Certified Public Accountant and is a member of the AICPA and the Texas Society of Certified Public Accountants.

John E. Sorrells
John is a Senior Manager with Arthur Andersen LLP in the Business Risk Consulting and Assurance practice primarily serving companies involved in the wholesale and retail trading of energy products.  John has performed reviews related to natural gas, power and liquids commodities transaction execution and capture, risk management, confirmation and settlement, logistics (scheduling, imbalances, and unaccounted for), gas accounting and financial reporting.  John has also performed special reviews of cash controls and the operational processes for management of accounts payable and receivable activities. 

Jane E. Champion
Jane is a Manager in the Energy Division of the Houston office Assurance practice of Arthur Andersen LLP.  Currently, she spends the majority of her time performing integrated audit services for clients in the energy trading industry with her primary focus on retail trading activities.  Jane obtained her Bachelor of Science from Louisiana State University and joined the firm in 1994.  Jane is a Certified Public Accountant.

